    "description": "Inspiration Mobility Group provides electric-vehicle infrastructure and fleet electrification solutions for commercial fleet operators. The platform serves customers that need vehicles, charging, and operating support, and its model combines service delivery with ownership and deployment of charging assets. At launch, the company announced a fleet partnership with Revel and an initial $200 million capital commitment from ArcLight, and later stated that it had grown to more than 60 employees with thousands of EVs on the road. Its footprint is U.S.-focused and tied to commercial fleet use cases rather than passenger retail charging alone. ArcLight backed the launch in November 2021 and Macquarie Asset Management and Ferrovial later provided additional capital in 2024, while public sources do not disclose the detailed ownership percentages.",
